One Marvel fan posted side-by-side images of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:12.600
the character from the movie&nbsp;
and the comics, and added,

00:03:22.440 --> 00:03:27.600
With the deluge of comments that are both&nbsp;
for and against this new version of MODOK,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:31.440
it will be interesting to see what&nbsp;
